{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Noctis</strong></i> is a first-person psychological horror game that traps the player in a labyrinth consumed by darkness. Armed only with a flashlight, you must explore, solve puzzles, and confront your own fears to progress. Every step in the dark may reveal a new threat...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/extras/941d6f350bdefe2948c805a5503e08dd.avif?t=1758901392\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Dark Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost within shifting architecture, the player must find their way by collecting items, deciphering codes, and using scarce sources of light to survive. The shadowy corridors hide as many answers as they do dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/extras/b65bee9270a565c757d17352421372b0.poster.avif?t=1758901392\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/extras/b65bee9270a565c757d17352421372b0.webm?t=1758901392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/extras/b65bee9270a565c757d17352421372b0.mp4?t=1758901392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you\u2019ll face puzzles that bring you closer to the truth. Notes, mechanisms, and mysterious symbols will stand in your way, testing both your mind and your courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/extras/e50119c6260f81447211ba336e186bab.poster.avif?t=1758901392\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/extras/e50119c6260f81447211ba336e186bab.webm?t=1758901392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/extras/e50119c6260f81447211ba336e186bab.mp4?t=1758901392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feel the Fear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oppressive sound design, flickering lights, and unpredictable apparitions create an immersive, terrifying experience. <i><strong>Noctis</strong></i> doesn\u2019t just aim to scare you\u2014it drags you into a waking nightmare.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011170?t=1758901392","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/8c6912a10e80d911100c0d6fabb846e3d45daf2a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758901392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/61c9ac071f15d6c13a909bb652800f9be073bbb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758901392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/61c9ac071f15d6c13a909bb652800f9be073bbb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758901392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains psychological horror elements, dark environments, and sudden scares that may not be suitable for all audiences. Player discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About this game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Noctis</strong></i> is a first-person psychological horror game that traps the player in a labyrinth consumed by darkness. Armed only with a flashlight, you must explore, solve puzzles, and confront your own fears to progress. Every step in the dark may reveal a new threat...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/extras/941d6f350bdefe2948c805a5503e08dd.avif?t=1758901392\" width=600 height=140 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Dark Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost within shifting architecture, the player must find their way by collecting items, deciphering codes, and using scarce sources of light to survive. The shadowy corridors hide as many answers as they do dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/extras/b65bee9270a565c757d17352421372b0.poster.avif?t=1758901392\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/extras/b65bee9270a565c757d17352421372b0.webm?t=1758901392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011170/extras/b65bee9270a565c757d17352421372b0.mp4?t=1758901392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey, you\u2019ll face puzzles that bring you closer to the truth. Notes, mechanisms, and mysterious symbols will stand in your way, testing both your mind and your courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\"